OL,3,GNEWSADUP MP says unionists angry over
OL,4,AMichelle O'Neill's role in protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA DUP MP says unionist voters are angry
OL,7,Fat Michelle O'Neill over her role in
OL,8,Fthe Garvaghy Road protests and says it
OL,9,F"cannot be business as usual" at
OL,10,FStormont.
OL,12,FCarla Lockhart said the DUP has it
OL,13,F"within it's gift to remove" O'Neill as
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland's first minister.
OL,16,FOn Friday, the secretary of state
OL,17,Fbanned the Portadown District Lodge
OL,18,Ffrom marching down the mainly
OL,19,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road. His decision
OL,20,Fwas welcomed by nationalist politicians
OL,21,Fbut unionists have criticised the move.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
