OL,3,GNEWSADUP MP says unionists angry over
OL,4,AMichelle O'Neill's role in protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Neill is one of a number of Sinn Fein
OL,7,Fpoliticians who have confirmed they
OL,8,Freceived letters from the Police
OL,9,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)
OL,10,Finvestigating protests over the
OL,11,FDrumcree parading dispute.
